<h2>The Complete 27-Point Website Conversion Checklist</h2>
<p>Use this checklist to audit your own contractor website. Score each item: 0 = Missing, 1 = Weak, 2 = Strong.</p>
<h3>Critical (Fix First)</h3>
<ul class="checklist">
<li>[ ] Mobile responsiveness — site works perfectly on phones</li>
<li>[ ] Page load speed under 2.5 seconds (test on mobile)</li>
<li>[ ] Sticky tap-to-call button on mobile</li>
<li>[ ] Clickable phone number in header on every page</li>
<li>[ ] Above-the-fold CTA with benefit-driven copy</li>
<li>[ ] Emergency messaging (if applicable) — 24/7, response time</li>
<li>[ ] Trust signals above fold — license, insurance, certifications</li>
<li>[ ] Real Google reviews embedded on homepage</li>
<li>[ ] Authentic photos (team, trucks, projects) — no stock images</li>
<li>[ ] Contact form with 3–4 fields max</li>
</ul>
<h3>Important (Fix Next)</h3>
<ul class="checklist">
